{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573020/extras/Abouthisgame.png?t=1741300822\" /><br><br>Arm yourself with sticky boots, a smart-pistol, and the titular 'Goosthetic' grappling prosthetic to swing, slide, jump, boost, and shoot your way out of a twisted and abandoned scientific facility! <i>Goosthetic</i> is a fast-paced action-platformer FPS that follows a rejected human subject as he tries to escape captivity and dodge freakish slime mutations as fast as possible.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573020/extras/Gamefeatures.png?t=1741300822\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use a plethora of movement abilities</strong> to navigate through the lab at high speeds. <strong>Run, jump, slide, boost, and grapple your way out!</strong><br></li><li><strong>Annihilate Exploders, Turrets, and flying Dummies</strong> with your pistol, one at a time with single-fire action or multiple with its Lock-On ability.<br></li><li><strong>Enjoy a rich, gooey environment and fantastic music</strong> to jam to as you dodge obstacles as quickly as you can.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573020/extras/Aboutdevelopment.png?t=1741300822\" /><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573020?t=1741300822","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573020/c3fe7956314017b41da29be019442d34ea9f3176/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741300822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573020/28136acbd0f02336918f7c3145b1ad15b8daf5a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741300822",